            0.416,
            0.803,
            0.494
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Puneeth’s father went from Lucknow to Kanpur in 2 hours by riding his motorcycle at a speed of 50 km/h. If he drives at 75 km/h, how long will it take him to reach Kanpur? Can we form this problem as a proportion—"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.817,
            0.416,
            0.905,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.817,
                0.416,
                0.905,
                0.469
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_12_image_4.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.427,
            0.497,
            0.546,
            0.517
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_12_equation_5.jpg",
          "content": "50:2:75:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.521,
            0.847,
            0.559
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Would it take Puneeth’s father more time or less time to reach Kanpur? Think about it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.558,
            0.761,
            0.596
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Even though this problem looks similar to the previous problems, it cannot be solved using the Rule of Three!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.595,
            0.761,
            0.634
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The time of travel would actually decrease when the speed increases. So this problem cannot be modelled as 50 : 2 :: 75 : __."
            }
          ]
        },
